# Search clear (LOCKED)

When creating a search field with a clear action, use the lock in
`src/Products/PinoyBusinessPOS/ExItS.PinoyBusinessPOS.React/src/features/ui-standards/search-clear-global-default.ts`.

- Intent / color: primary (`SEARCH_CLEAR_GLOBAL_COLOR` = `var(--exits-primary)`)
- Mark: Lucide `X` with bold stroke `SEARCH_CLEAR_GLOBAL_STROKE` = **3**
- Icon size: `SEARCH_CLEAR_GLOBAL_ICON_SIZE` = **1rem**

Use this on:

- `SearchField` / `ExitsSearchField` (`.exits-search-field__clear`)
- Locked search input (`PlaygroundSearchField` / clearable ExItS input)
- Dropdown panel search clear (`.ui-standards-qdropdown__search-clear`)

Do not use a muted grey clear, a thin default Lucide stroke (2), or a different color unless the user names one.

Change this lock only when the user asks. Update `search-clear-global-default.ts`, the matching CSS (`globals.css` / `exits-qfield.css`), and `search-clear-global-default.test.ts` together.
